rooms_desc ({"You stand in front of a castle belonging to one of the Highland clans.  Fiercelooking clansmen glance briefly at you, then continue to scan the horizon forany sign of invaders.  It seems you are no threat, and may enter.","In the castle's main courtyard, you stand stunned by the wild festivity.  Tothe east sits a low hall, from which the sounds of drunken revelry flow.  Northof you lies the main hall, where the chieftain sits in judgement.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","It is hard to see in here because of the smoke given off by the roasting pits.As your eyes adjust to the dim light, you realize that you have stepped into themiddle of a great feast.  While the warriors boast of their latest victory,servants tend the roasting boars.  It seems the golden mead is flowing freelytonight.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"In front of a majestic castle","Castle courtyard","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","Feasting hall",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
